title USB gadget: boot, bind, enumeration and data transfer

participant "host (PC)" as host
participant "UDC (dwc3 gadget)" as UDC
participant "composite / configfs" as composite
participant "function (f_hid)" as func
participant "userspace" as app

note over UDC,func: kernel boot (built-in / module load)
UDC->composite: dwc3 probe -> **usb_add_gadget_udc()**\n(/sys/class/udc/<udc>)
func->composite: **usb_function_register(&hidusb_func)**
note over composite,func: libcomposite keeps alloc_inst() / alloc_func()

note right of app: gadget setup via configfs
app->composite: **mkdir** functions/hid.usb0
composite->func: alloc_inst()
app->composite: **ln -s** functions/hid.usb0 configs/b.1
composite->func: alloc_func()
app->composite: **write <udc> > UDC**
composite->composite: usb_gadget_register_driver()
composite->func: **bind(c, f)**
func->UDC: usb_ep_autoconfig() -> claim EP IN/OUT
func->func: build fs/hs/ss descriptors
func->app: create /dev/hidg0
composite->UDC: udc_start() + usb_gadget_connect()
UDC->host: **pull-up D+** (soft connect)

note left of host: device plugged in

host->UDC: **SET_ADDRESS**
note over UDC: handled inside UDC driver\n(gadget driver not involved)

host->UDC: GET_DESCRIPTOR(**DEVICE**)
UDC->composite: composite_setup()
composite->UDC: usb_ep_queue(ep0, **device desc**)
UDC-->host: VID/PID, class, #config

host->UDC: GET_DESCRIPTOR(**CONFIG**)
UDC->composite: composite_setup()
composite->composite: config_desc(): collect function descriptors
composite->UDC: usb_ep_queue(ep0, **config desc**)
UDC-->host: config + interfaces + endpoints

note left of host: device configured
host->UDC: **SET_CONFIGURATION**
UDC->composite: composite_setup() -> set_config()
composite->func: **set_alt(f, intf, alt)**
func->UDC: config_ep_by_speed() + **usb_ep_enable(ep_in, ep_out)**
func->UDC: usb_ep_queue(ep_out, req) (ready to receive)

note left of host: Device sending data
app->func: **write(/dev/hidg0, report)**
func->UDC: **usb_ep_queue(ep_in, req)**
note over UDC,func: request armed, sent on the next IN token

loop every bInterval
    host->UDC: IN token
    alt no request queued
        UDC-->host: NAK
    else request queued
        UDC-->host: data
        host->UDC: ACK
        UDC->func: req->complete() callback
        func->app: wake up writer (next write allowed)
    end
end
